ass=\"lex-tr\">judgment</b>.. ? <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">330c</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">450a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ ἐμὴ ψ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57a</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">d</span> <span class=\"gk\">Ἀθηνᾶς ψ.,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">calculus Minervae,</b> prov. phrase to express <b class=\"lex-tr\">acquittal,</b> when the votes were even, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Philostr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VS</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">e</span> <span class=\"gk\">ψ.</span> is sts. omitted, <span class=\"gk\">κἂν ἴσαι γένωνται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">685</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">πάσαις κρατεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> </span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">Bis Acc.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">f</span> <span class=\"gk\">Διὸς ψῆφος </span>( <span class=\"gk\">ψῆφοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> ), prov. <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ τῶν ἱερῶν καὶ ἀθίκτων,</span> of the scene of contest betw. Athena and Poseidon, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Suid.</span> </span>, 